    "chunk_text": "he ne mihte na his hand \u00dea ongan he \u00fe\u00e6r standan earm mid his here\u00f0e swa scyldig & swa gebunden, & he wolde \u00feone Swa \u00fea wundorlicum gemete se \u00feeof, se \u00fee ondred, \u00fe\u00e6t he sceolde beon gesewen & ongyten & he \u00fea stod \u00fe\u00e6r ealle \u00fea niht unastyrigendlic & him w\u00e6ron gebundene \u00fea fet & \u00fea handa. \u00dea \u00fea hit w\u00e6s mergen geworden, & \u00fe\u00e6t Godes lof w\u00e6s gefylled, & \u00fea preostas ut eodon of \u00f0\u00e6re \u00dea w\u00e6s \u00feam bro\u00f0rum on tweo, hwe\u00f0er he \u00feone we\u00f0er gename, \u00fee he hine \u00feider brohte. Ac se scyldiga swi\u00f0e hra\u00f0e as\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6s gyltes wite. \u00dea wundredon ealle \u00fea bro\u00f0ra, for\u00f0on \u00fee se in gangenda \u00feeof stod swa gebunden \u00e6t his agenre Petrus cw\u00e6\u00f0: nu \u00e6teowa\u00f0, hu mycelre wynsumnesse se \u00e6lmihtiga God is ofer us, \u00fe\u00e6s swa Gregorius him andswarode: Prenestine \u00fe\u00e6re byrig hlifa\u00f0 an munt, ofer \u00f0am munte is mynster & me gelamp, \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6s in \u00feam mynstre & gehyrde myccle wundor, \u00fe\u00e6t ic her \u00e6fter Witodlice in \u00feam ylcan mynstre w\u00e6s sum swi\u00f0e arwyr\u00f0es lifes f\u00e6der, se w\u00e6s fedende sumne & \u00fea \u00fea he geseah hine weaxan & \u00feeon in Godes ege, he gedyde, \u00fe\u00e6t hine man hadode to \u00dea sona \u00e6fter his hadunga him w\u00e6s getacnod \u00feurh sume onwrignesse , \u00fe\u00e6t hit n\u00e6s nah",
